<slide>
  class: spotlight
  valign: center
</slide>

## class: spotlight

This slide adds the CSS class `spotlight`, defined in the deck's own `deck.css`
(loaded via `"css": "deck.css"` in `deck.json`).

`valign: center` centers this slide's content vertically.

<notes>
  deck.css can restyle anything: .stage.spotlight .item h2 { ... }
</notes>
